"note_claim": "Viral videos claiming to show the Bee Gees' grandchildren singing actually feature Australian singer Ky Baldwin, who is not related to the group.",
"label": "SUPPORTS",
"quote": "Rather, it was a cover recording of the song by Ky Baldwin, a singer and actor from Australia.",
